# PRISM progress planner: toward a cell that feels alive

Updated 2026-10-27 18:45. A living cell **senses**, **decides**, **acts**, **remembers**, **learns**, **stays safe**,
**recovers** and **tells you how it is doing**, all without being told. This page tracks how far each of those is.

## How the percentages are counted

| Mark | Meaning | Counts as |
|---|---|---|
| ✅ | built **and proven on the real machine** | 100 % |
| 🧪 | built and passes the simulator tests, **not yet proven on the machine** | 60 % |
| 🔜 | next up, not built yet | 0 % |
| ⬜ | later / needs hardware or a decision | 0 % |

A topic's % = the average of its items. The overall % = the average of the topics.

